{
  title = "a closure under a property wrapper";
  adr = "0025 item 1, 0010 §4(a), den-hoag-crk5e";
  what = "`wrapped-closure-is-lowered-as-unwrapped`: under C197's mounted cnf, a closure in `includes = mkIf true [ … ]` (`hem`), under a module's `config = mkIf true { … }` (`pleat`) and at the class key `nixos = mkIf true …` (`seam`) is lowered to the door node its unwrapped control is, in condition and firing; at the class key the `mkIf` rides on the class value inside the lifted node, so `seamOff`'s `mkIf false` registers and delivers nothing, and a class-key closure under `mkForce` is refused by name at the loader (row 161). Before, `hem` and `pleat` were refused by gen-aspects' bare-closure refusal and `seam` was delivered with its guard dropped";
}
